      "raw": "[quote=\"Silverleaf\"]\n\nWhen it says &quot;the first time&quot;, it means &quot;the first time&quot;. Not &quot;the first time you think it&#39;s worth it&quot;. ;)\n\n[/quote]\n\nWell this changes everything.&nbsp; That&#39;s how I was playing the entire game.&nbsp; &quot;Kismet deals everyone 2 psychic damage...if you think it&#39;s worth it.&quot;\n\nBut, thanks for clearing it up; I had always assumed the &quot;first time&quot; text was there to keep people from redirecting every instance of damage during the turn.\n",
